        "slc_ea2d29bc32a1ead29ec3f0677b5bad460542205531e2876fa45717d39aab5092"
      ],
      "text": "Improving existing code is done by placing a `prompt` file in the target code folder and running `gpte <project_dir> -i`."
    },
